  "label": "Metaphor for Opportunity or Permission",
  "description": "The 'signal light' metaphor in the meme is used to imply that transgender people are waiting for an opportunity or permission to engage in begging or solicitation. This metaphor is degrading and implies that transgender people are opportunistic and morally inferior. It is a harmful stereotype that is used to dehumanize and marginalize transgender people.",
